Q: Modify AdminCount to zero A: <p>Found the answer but only issue is that it will only change the value if it contains a value like 1.  If you used the clear function and it is now NULL then you can't use this command.  At least this is what I'm finding in my test.</p>

<pre><code>Set-Aduser -Identity XXXX -Replace @{adminCount=0}
</code></pre>
